IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SWIFTINFER-TREE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-BRANCHES        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 PRUNED-COUNT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 TREE-DEPTH          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-X10         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SWIFTINFER.
    IF NUM-BRANCHES == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 4 TO TREE-DEPTH.
    MOVE 24 TO SPEEDUP-X10.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TREE-DEPTH.
    WEIGHT 30 SPEEDUP-X10.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
